   "source": [
    "## Section 8: Aaj Humne Kya Seekha?\n",
    "\n",
    "### Summary:\n",
    "1. **Customer Segmentation** — Real business problem solved with clustering\n",
    "2. **Elbow + Silhouette** — Optimal K find karne ke 2 methods\n",
    "3. **Hierarchical** — Dendrogram se structure samjha\n",
    "4. **DBSCAN** — Noise/outlier customers detect kiye\n",
    "5. **Business Naming** — Clusters ko readable segments mein convert kiya\n",
    "\n",
    "### Real-World Uses:\n",
    "- **E-commerce:** Myntra, Flipkart — user segments for targeted offers\n",
    "- **Banking:** Customer tiers (Basic, Silver, Gold, Platinum)\n",
    "- **Healthcare:** Patient risk groups\n",
    "- **Marketing:** Email campaign segmentation\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "## Capstone Challenge\n",
    "\n",
    "**Problem:** Iris dataset pe saare 3 clustering algorithms apply karo.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Tasks:**\n",
    "1. Load `load_iris()` — 4 features, 150 samples, 3 known species\n",
    "2. Standardize and apply PCA (2D) for visualization\n",
    "3. Apply K-Means with K=3 on original scaled features\n",
    "4. Apply Hierarchical Clustering with K=3\n",
    "5. Apply DBSCAN with eps=0.5, min_samples=5\n",
    "6. For each algorithm, plot the 2D PCA visualization colored by cluster\n",
    "7. Compare silhouette scores of all 3 algorithms\n",
    "8. Compare K-Means clusters with true labels (Adjusted Rand Index)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# CAPSTONE — TRY YOURSELF FIRST!\n",
    "from sklearn.datasets import load_iris\n",
    "\n",
    "iris = load_iris()\n",
    "X_iris, y_iris = iris.data, iris.target\n",
    "print(f\"Iris: {X_iris.shape}, species: {iris.target_names}\")\n",
    "print(\"Your turn! Apply all 3 clustering algorithms...\")\n",
    "# YOUR CODE HERE\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Solutions — Capstone"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# === SOLUTION ===\n",
    "from sklearn.datasets import load_iris\n",
    "from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n",
    "from sklearn.decomposition import PCA\n",
    "from sklearn.cluster import KMeans, AgglomerativeClustering, DBSCAN\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import silhouette_score, adjusted_rand_score\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "iris = load_iris()\n",
    "X_iris, y_iris = iris.data, iris.target\n",
    "\n",
    "# Tasks 2: Scale + PCA\n",
    "X_iris_scaled = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_iris)\n",
    "X_iris_2d = PCA(n_components=2).fit_transform(X_iris_scaled)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Task 3-5: Apply algorithms\n",
    "km = KMeans(n_clusters=3, random_state=42, n_init=10)\n",
    "agg = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=3, linkage='ward')\n",
    "db = DBSCAN(eps=0.5, min_samples=5)\n",
    "\n",
    "km_labels = km.fit_predict(X_iris_scaled)\n",
    "agg_labels = agg.fit_predict(X_iris_scaled)\n",
    "db_labels = db.fit_predict(X_iris_scaled)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Task 6: Visualize\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 4, figsize=(16, 4))\n",
    "all_labels = [y_iris, km_labels, agg_labels, db_labels]\n",
    "titles = ['True Labels', 'K-Means (K=3)', 'Hierarchical (K=3)', 'DBSCAN']\n",
    "\n",
    "for ax, labels, title in zip(axes, all_labels, titles):\n",
    "    unique = set(labels)\n",
    "    scatter_colors = ['red', 'green', 'blue', 'gray']\n",
    "    for i, lbl in enumerate(sorted(unique)):\n",
    "        mask = labels == lbl\n",
    "        name = 'Noise' if lbl == -1 else f'Cluster {lbl}'\n",
    "        ax.scatter(X_iris_2d[mask, 0], X_iris_2d[mask, 1],\n",
    "                   c=scatter_colors[i % len(scatter_colors)], label=name, alpha=0.7, s=30)\n",
    "    ax.set_title(title)\n",
    "    ax.legend(fontsize=7)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle('Iris Clustering Comparison', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Task 7-8: Scores\n",
    "print(\"=== Silhouette Scores ===\")\n",
    "print(f\"K-Means:      {silhouette_score(X_iris_scaled, km_labels):.3f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Hierarchical: {silhouette_score(X_iris_scaled, agg_labels):.3f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "n_db = len(set(db_labels)) - (1 if -1 in db_labels else 0)\n",
    "if n_db > 1:\n",
    "    valid_mask = db_labels != -1\n",
    "    print(f\"DBSCAN:       {silhouette_score(X_iris_scaled[valid_mask], db_labels[valid_mask]):.3f} (excluding noise)\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"DBSCAN:       N/A ({n_db} clusters found — try different eps)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== Adjusted Rand Index (vs True Labels) ===\")\n",
    "print(f\"K-Means ARI:      {adjusted_rand_score(y_iris, km_labels):.3f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Hierarchical ARI: {adjusted_rand_score(y_iris, agg_labels):.3f}\")\n",
    "print(\"(1.0 = perfect match, 0 = random)\")"
   ]
  }
